        },
        {
          "name": "Data",
          "type": "String&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Name",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Previously, some code was serializing strings as GetCharArray, which includes the null terminator,\nand we did not want to change behavior because it would change the key. Those sites call UpdateLegacyString\ninstead, and the subclasses that want to preserve the key override it.",
